Parakeet Ultra, the speech model setup downloads for recordings
Parakeet Ultra by Moondream (https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra),
a post-training of NVIDIA's Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, converted to ONNX by Masterx.
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0).
Source: https://huggingface.co/Masterx/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-ultra-onnx
Changes: none to the weights; the fp16 files are saved as encoder-model.onnx
and decoder_joint-model.onnx, the names VoxType loads.

